After parallelPre...Note: parallelPrefix() is explained with very basic operations you can try performing different operation on arrays by writing different lambda expressions of Java 8. Why should we use parallelPrefix() when we can do it sequentially?Parallel operations are much faster on larger size arrays, but it usually depends on the Machine.We use lambda while performing a parallel operation, which reduces the number of lines in the code, making it more elegant and readable.
